<title>ITALY: Gross yields fall at Italian BTP bond auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yields fall at Italian BTP bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a first tranche of 2.5 trillion lire worth of three-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (Btp) with a 6.00 pct coupon, and a seventh tranche of 2.0 trillion lire of five-year Btps carrying a 6.25 pct coupon.</p>
<p>		  Feb 15, 2000   pvs	Jan 1, 2002	pvs</p>
<p> Net Yield	 5.33 pct    5.40	  5.58 pct	5.62</p>
<p> Gross Yield     6.11 pct    6.18	  6.40 pct	6.44</p>
<p> Assigned price 99.95	 99.75	 99.75	   99.60</p>
<p> Bids	     7.710 trln lire	  4.359 trln lire</p>
<p> Assigned	 2.500 trln lire	  2.000 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparisons are with a previous auction on January 31.</p>
</text>
